A can complete a piece of work in 12 days, while B can complete the same work in 18 days. If they work together, how many days will they take to complete the work?
A) 6 days
B) 7.2 days
C) 8 days
D) 9 days
Solution: 
        A=1/12
        B=1/18
        sum=1/12+1/18
        sum = 5/36
        sum = 7.2 days

Answer : B
